surface.md
.obsidian/workspace*

# Projection outputs (hub/project.py) and health state. Deliberately NOT tracked:
# design-08 check 3 asserts the manifest's projected sha == main HEAD, so committing
# these would move HEAD past the manifest and make the check fail every single run.
# Leaving them untracked also keeps the tree clean for sync.sh's post-merge guard.
hub/projection-manifest.json
hub/surface-chatgpt.md
hub/surface-claude-ai.md
hub/health-state.json
hub/synthesis-report.json

# Local merge artifacts, rewritten every nightly run. merge-state.json is the
# merge's liveness stamp and digest-*.md its per-day report; both are derived
# from a run, not brain content, and tracking either would leave the tree dirty
# every night and halt loreport-sync's post-merge guard. The engine's own
# .gitignore does not reach here — a brain gets this file once, at init.
hub/merge-state.json
hub/digest-*.md
